{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMS9PSy1Db21wdXRlci0lMjhIaW5kaS1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"OK Computer (Hindi series 2021)","description":"The year is 2031. In a New India - of towering smart holograms and drone superhighways - hard-boiled Cyber Crime detective Saajan Kundu is called out of retirement when a self-driving taxi is hacked and ordered to kill an anonymous human victim. Saajan begrudgingly joins forces with estranged partner Laxmi Suri, a whip-smart AI scientist, to comb the modern backwaters of Goa for the killer.\n\nEnded · First aired 26 Mar 2021 · India · Language: Hindi\nStudio: Memesys Culture Lab · Network: Disney+ Hotstar\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Comedy","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMS9PSy1Db21wdXRlci0lMjhIaW5kaS1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8.1.1","title":"Auto-Pilot","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2021-03-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When a self-driving car kills a pedestrian, prickly Cyber Cell detective Saajan Kundu teams up with his estranged partner Laxmi Suri to investigate. But was this an accident?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lrMChqIrIEBcyga3nnl7PmZ9N0e.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMS9PSy1Db21wdXRlci0lMjhIaW5kaS1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8.1.2","title":"Making of a Messiah","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2021-03-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Cyber Cell reminisces Ajeeb the robot's meteoric rise as a saviour of humankind. However, when it's brought in as the chief murder suspect, it seems to be a bumbling shadow of its former self.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/toWIjHvyxRDYeK9wBUyv5UrW3JE.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMS9PSy1Db21wdXRlci0lMjhIaW5kaS1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8.1.3","title":"